WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.518
Antes de subir a un autobús, pregunta: Does this bus

00:00:03.646 --> 00:00:06.803
go to the airport? Para saber el precio: How much

00:00:06.873 --> 00:00:10.472
is the fare? Si necesitas ayuda, di: Could you help

00:00:10.542 --> 00:00:15.395
me, please? Los recorridos de esta práctica son ficticios. Confirma

00:00:15.453 --> 00:00:17.856
siempre la ruta real antes de viajar.
